  lines.push("");
  lines.push("Eligibility, margins, and terms are subject to program guidelines and can change.");
  lines.push("");
  lines.push("### Frequently asked questions");
  lines.push("");
  lines.push("**Q: What is the CMG All In One Loan™?**");
  lines.push("");
  lines.push("It is a 30-year first-lien home equity line of credit with a built-in sweep checking account, offered by CMG Home Loans. It replaces a traditional mortgage on a purchase or refinance.");
